WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.620
Ghana's credit market processed 29.5 million
inquiries in 2024, more than

00:06.620 --> 00:12.740
double the year before. The demand is here.
What is missing? The infrastructure.

00:13.440 --> 00:19.480
Cross-border ecosystem lending. Mobile money
data integration. Multi-ID borrower

00:19.480 --> 00:25.000
verification. That is what Universal Credit
Hub provides. A production-ready

00:25.000 --> 00:30.060
platform built for Ghana's financial
institutions. What I am about to show you

00:30.060 --> 00:33.840
is operational software ready for
deployment today.
